{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":false,"title":"Content Month Plan"},"description":"Plan a content month for an agency: up to 30 posts with topics, publish dates and linked production dates, bundled shoot days, holidays per region, conflicts and an .ics file. EN/DE. Returns: JSON with language, plan_id, period, today, summary, posts, shoot_days, conflicts, warnings, posts_for_reschedule, next_step, holiday_region, holidays, calendar_file_ics, coverage. PAID: 0.05 USDC per call (USDC on eip155:8453, x402 v2). Requires an x402-capable MCP client that attaches the payment in _meta[\"x402/payment\"] (e.g. createx402MCPClient from @x402/mcp). Without a payment this tool returns a \"payment required\" result and charges nothing. NOTE: Rule-based, German or English (language), no AI model, stateless. Send periods, counts, weekdays and your already booked dates only, no personal data. Topics are suggestions from built-in recipes, not a content strategy. Nothing is written to any calendar; the .ics text is yours to import.","inputSchema":{"additionalProperties":false,"properties":{"avoid_weekends":{"default":true,"type":"boolean"},"break_minutes":{"default":15,"maximum":60,"minimum":0,"type":"integer"},"categories":{"default":["produkt","mitarbeiter","bts"],"items":{"enum":["produkt","mitarbeiter","bts","wissen","kunde","unternehmen","recruiting"],"type":"string"},"maxItems":7,"minItems":1,"type":"array"},"existing_publish_dates":{"default":[],"description":"Publish dates already taken.","items":{"pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":60,"type":"array"},"existing_shoot_dates":{"default":[],"description":"Shoot days already booked.","items":{"pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"maxItems":60,"type":"array"},"from":{"pattern":"^\\d{4}-\\d{2}-\\d{2}$","type":"string"},"holiday_region":{"default":"none","enum":["none","DE-BW","DE-BY","DE-BE","DE-BB","DE-HB","DE-HH","DE-HE","DE